{
  "title": "LogSentinel Overview",
  "description": "Historical Sysmon activity, window scoring and reported detections. Separate stream counts; event-time scope follows the selected range.",
  "options": {
    "auto_apply_filters": true,
    "hide_panel_borders": false,
    "hide_panel_titles": false,
    "sync_colors": false,
    "sync_cursor": true,
    "sync_tooltips": true,
    "use_margins": true
  },
  "query": {
    "language": "kql",
    "expression": ""
  },
  "filters": [],
  "tags": [],
  "time_range": {
    "from": "now-1y",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "refresh_interval": {
    "pause": true,
    "value": 0
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": "677e31a4-834b-5ab7-a939-4a1c5192b7c5",
      "type": "markdown",
      "grid": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 48,
        "h": 6
      },
      "config": {
        "title": "Monitoring overview",
        "content": "**Historical monitoring** · Filter `host.name` and select a stored session. Telemetry events → overlapping scored windows → reported detections. A detection is a reported window, not a confirmed infection or unique incident.\n\n**Navigate:** [Overview](/app/dashboards#/view/logsentinel-overview) | [Detections](/app/dashboards#/view/ransomware-detections) | [Window Scores](/app/dashboards#/view/window-scores) | [Windows Telemetry](/app/dashboards#/view/windows-telemetry) | [Telemetry Quality](/app/dashboards#/view/telemetry-quality)"
      }
    },
